{
 "_about": "Synthetic raw ChatGPT message shapes (one per known content type) with the normalized output required by src/protocol/types.js. Inputs mirror shapes seen in core.js/tests on main; `expect` lists only the fields each case pins down. Workstream A owns this file and may add cases; do not weaken existing expectations without a plan update.",
